note stand-in for lay.om export 0 (absorb c edit blk d view uchar *): blk a (uint, bytes 0..3) gets the
note byte sum modulo 2^32, n (ulong, bytes 8..15) the count, both little endian.
fn absorb c edit uchar 24 d view uchar 16777216 m ulong to void
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4
s = or s shl ulong get c i mul i 8
end
for i ulong m
s = and add s ulong get d i 4294967295
end
for i ulong 4
put c i uchar and shr s mul i 8 255
end
n = ulong 0
for i ulong 8
n = or n shl ulong get c add 8 i mul i 8
end
n = add n m
for i ulong 8
put c add 8 i uchar and shr n mul i 8 255
end
end
